{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:56:45+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:56:45+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Verbio SE","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"Germany","city":"Leipzig","website":"https://www.verbio.de","employees":1332,"summary":"Verbio SE engages in the production and distribution of fuels and finished products in Germany, Europe, North America, and internationally. It operates through Biodiesel, Bioethanol/Biomethane, and Other segments. The company provides bio-based chemicals, biodiesel, pharma-glycerine, biomethane, and bioethanol; olefin metathesis catalysts; animal feeds, such as Verbio Proti Flow and Verbio Grain Pro; phytosterols under the Sterocellent brand name; and fertilizers. It also offers trading, and transport and logistics services. The company's products are used for cosmetics, food, pharmaceuticals, heat and power generation, fuels, renewable chemicals, aromas and fragrances, plastics, agrochemicals, and agriculture applications. It serves oil, oil mills, pharmaceuticals, trading and logistics, transport and fleet operators, energy utilities, farmers, LNG/CNG filling stations/retail, and other sectors. The company was formerly known as VERBIO Vereinigte BioEnergie AG and changed its name to Verbio SE in December 2023. Verbio SE was founded in 2006 and is based in Leipzig, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Verbio SE s’engage dans la production et la distribution de carburants et de produits finis en Allemagne, en Europe, en Amérique du Nord et à l’international. Il opère à travers les segments Biodiesel, Bioéthanol/Biométhane et Autres. La société fournit des produits chimiques biosourcés, du biodiesel, de la pharma-glycérine, du biométhane et du bioéthanol; des catalyseurs de métathèse des oléfines; des aliments pour animaux, tel